msgid "You are now signed out on all other browsers and devices."
msgstr "Je bent nu uitgelogd op alle andere browsers en apparaten."

msgid "Download your data first."
msgstr "Download eerst je gegevens."

msgid "Sign in again to confirm this request."
msgstr "Log opnieuw in om dit verzoek te bevestigen."

#, python-format
msgid "We sent a confirmation code to %(email)s."
msgstr "We hebben een bevestigingscode naar %(email)s gestuurd."

msgid "Enter the 6-digit code."
msgstr "Voer de code van 6 cijfers in."

msgid "That code has expired. Request a new one."
msgstr "Die code is verlopen. Vraag een nieuwe aan."

msgid "Too many attempts. Request a new code."
msgstr "Te veel pogingen. Vraag een nieuwe code aan."

msgid "Incorrect code."
msgstr "Onjuiste code."

msgid "Your account and all your data have been removed."
msgstr "Je account en al je gegevens zijn verwijderd."

msgid "Enter your email to sign in."
msgstr "Voer je e-mailadres in om in te loggen."

#, python-format
msgid "We sent a verification code to %(email)s."
msgstr "We hebben een verificatiecode naar %(email)s gestuurd."

msgid "Enter your email to get a verification code."
msgstr "Voer je e-mailadres in om een verificatiecode te krijgen."

msgid "Email verified — you're signed in."
msgstr "E-mailadres bevestigd – je bent ingelogd."

#, python-format
msgid "We sent a new code to %(email)s."
msgstr "We hebben een nieuwe code naar %(email)s gestuurd."

msgid "Signed out."
msgstr "Uitgelogd."

#. NOTE: date,weight[,note] names the columns of a CSV line; translate the
#. names (note is optional).
#, python-format
msgid "line %(line)d: expected date,weight[,note]"
msgstr "regel %(line)d: verwacht datum,gewicht[,notitie]"

#, python-format
msgid "line %(line)d: invalid date %(value)s"
msgstr "regel %(line)d: ongeldige datum %(value)s"

#, python-format
msgid "line %(line)d: invalid weight %(value)s"
msgstr "regel %(line)d: ongeldig gewicht %(value)s"

#, python-format
msgid "line %(line)d: weight out of range"
msgstr "regel %(line)d: gewicht buiten bereik"

#. NOTE: The email subject; the code is at the end, with no full stop, so it
#. can be copied.
#, python-format
msgid "Your verification code is %(code)s"
msgstr "Je verificatiecode is %(code)s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your verification code is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"It expires in %(num)d minute. If you didn't request this, ignore this email."
msgid_plural ""
"Your verification code is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"It expires in %(num)d minutes. If you didn't request this, ignore this email."
msgstr[0] ""
"Je verificatiecode is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"De code verloopt over %(num)d minuut. Heb je dit niet aangevraagd? Negeer "
"dan deze e-mail."
msgstr[1] ""
"Je verificatiecode is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"De code verloopt over %(num)d minuten. Heb je dit niet aangevraagd? Negeer "
"dan deze e-mail."

msgid "Confirm removal of your data"
msgstr "Bevestig het verwijderen van je gegevens"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your confirmation code is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Entering it will permanently delete your account and all your weight data. "
"It expires in %(num)d minute. If you didn't request this, ignore this email "
"and your data stays untouched."
msgid_plural ""
"Your confirmation code is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Entering it will permanently delete your account and all your weight data. "
"It expires in %(num)d minutes. If you didn't request this, ignore this email"
" and your data stays untouched."
msgstr[0] ""
"Je bevestigingscode is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Als je de code invoert, worden je account en al je gewichtsgegevens "
"definitief verwijderd. De code verloopt over %(num)d minuut. Heb je dit niet"
" aangevraagd? Negeer dan deze e-mail; je gegevens blijven ongewijzigd."
msgstr[1] ""
"Je bevestigingscode is %(code)s.\n"
"\n"
"Als je de code invoert, worden je account en al je gewichtsgegevens "
"definitief verwijderd. De code verloopt over %(num)d minuten. Heb je dit "
"niet aangevraagd? Negeer dan deze e-mail; je gegevens blijven ongewijzigd."

msgid "That email domain doesn't accept mail (no MX record)."
msgstr "Dat e-maildomein accepteert geen e-mail (geen MX-record)."

msgid "Couldn't check that email domain right now. Try again."
msgstr "Dat e-maildomein kon nu niet worden gecontroleerd. Probeer het opnieuw."

msgid "Your session has expired. Reload the page and try again."
msgstr "Je sessie is verlopen. Laad de pagina opnieuw en probeer het nog eens."

msgid "Your session has expired and nothing was changed. Please try again."
msgstr "Je sessie is verlopen en er is niets gewijzigd. Probeer het opnieuw."

msgid "That page isn't available, so you were taken to the start page."
msgstr "Die pagina is niet beschikbaar, daarom ben je naar de startpagina gebracht."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The file is too large: the limit is %(size)s. Nothing was imported or "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Het bestand is te groot: de limiet is %(size)s. Er is niets geïmporteerd of "
"gewijzigd."

msgid "Something went wrong on our side. Please try again in a moment."
msgstr "Er ging aan onze kant iets mis. Probeer het zo nog eens."

msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-mailadres"

msgid "Verification code"
msgstr "Verificatiecode"

msgid "Enter the height as a plain number, e.g. 180 or 1.8."
msgstr "Voer de lengte in als een gewoon getal, bijvoorbeeld 180 of 1,8."

#. NOTE: Label of the body height field in the settings.
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Lengte"

msgid "Unit"
msgstr "Eenheid"

msgid "Dark mode"
msgstr "Donkere modus"

msgid "Moving average (days)"
msgstr "Voortschrijdend gemiddelde (dagen)"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Height must be between %(min_cm)s and %(max_cm)s cm (%(min_m)s and %(max_m)s"
" m)."
msgstr ""
"De lengte moet tussen %(min_cm)s en %(max_cm)s cm liggen (%(min_m)s en "
"%(max_m)s m)."

#. NOTE: Switch in the settings that makes the weight chart visible on a public
#. web page.
msgid "Share my chart on a public page"
msgstr "Deel mijn grafiek op een openbare pagina"

#. NOTE: Switch in the settings: show the kilograms on the public chart, or
#. only the shape of the line.
msgid "Show my weight"
msgstr "Toon mijn gewicht"

#. NOTE: Switch in the settings: show the boxes with the current average, BMI
#. and changes under the public chart.
msgid "Show the stat boxes on the public page"
msgstr "Toon de statistiekvakken op de openbare pagina"

#. NOTE: Label of the field with the last part of the public page's address
#. (the "ramon" in .../public/ramon).
msgid "Page ID"
msgstr "Pagina-ID"

#, python-format
msgid "Use %(min)d to %(max)d letters (a-z), digits, hyphens or underscores."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik %(min)d tot %(max)d letters (a-z), cijfers, koppeltekens of "
"liggende streepjes."

msgid "That ID is already taken. Choose another one."
msgstr "Die ID is al in gebruik. Kies een andere."

msgid "CSV or XML file"
msgstr "CSV- of XML-bestand"

msgid "CSV, XML or text files only."
msgstr "Alleen CSV-, XML- of tekstbestanden."

#, python-format
msgid "That file stores weights in %(unit)s, which can't be imported."
msgstr ""
"Dat bestand slaat gewichten op in %(unit)s, en dat kan niet worden "
"geïmporteerd."

msgid "That file isn't a valid Hacker's Diet XML export."
msgstr "Dat bestand is geen geldige XML-export van Hacker's Diet."

#, python-format
msgid "%(date)s: invalid date"
msgstr "%(date)s: ongeldige datum"

#, python-format
msgid "%(date)s: invalid weight %(value)s"
msgstr "%(date)s: ongeldig gewicht %(value)s"

#, python-format
msgid "%(date)s: weight out of range"
msgstr "%(date)s: gewicht buiten bereik"

#. NOTE: Rate of weight change. %(grams)s is a signed whole number; g is gram.
#, python-format
msgid "%(grams)s g/day"
msgstr "%(grams)s g/dag"

#. NOTE: Shown when too many sign-in codes were requested. %(num)d is a number
#. of minutes.
#, python-format
msgid "Too many requests. Try again in %(num)d minute."
msgid_plural "Too many requests. Try again in %(num)d minutes."
msgstr[0] "Te veel verzoeken. Probeer het over %(num)d minuut opnieuw."
msgstr[1] "Te veel verzoeken. Probeer het over %(num)d minuten opnieuw."

#. NOTE: Chart range button: the whole recorded history.
msgid "All"
msgstr "Alles"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 20 years. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "20Y"
msgstr "20J"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 15 years. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "15Y"
msgstr "15J"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 10 years. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "10Y"
msgstr "10J"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 5 years. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "5Y"
msgstr "5J"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 1 year. The letter is the unit, Y for year.
msgid "1Y"
msgstr "1J"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 6 months. The letter is the unit, M for month.
msgid "6M"
msgstr "6M"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 3 months. The letter is the unit, M for month.
msgid "3M"
msgstr "3M"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 1 month. The letter is the unit, M for month.
msgid "1M"
msgstr "1M"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 2 weeks. The letter is the unit, W for week.
msgid "2W"
msgstr "2W"

#. NOTE: Chart range button: 1 week. The letter is the unit, W for week.
msgid "1W"
msgstr "1W"

# machine-translated
#. NOTE: Screen-reader name of a chart range button such as 5Y.
#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d year"
msgid_plural "%(num)d years"
msgstr[0] "%(num)d jaar"
msgstr[1] "%(num)d jaar"

# machine-translated
#. NOTE: Screen-reader name of a chart range button such as 3M.
#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d month"
msgid_plural "%(num)d months"
msgstr[0] "%(num)d maand"
msgstr[1] "%(num)d maanden"

# machine-translated
#. NOTE: Screen-reader name of a chart range button such as 2W.
#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d week"
msgid_plural "%(num)d weeks"
msgstr[0] "%(num)d week"
msgstr[1] "%(num)d weken"

#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d-day change"
msgid_plural "%(num)d-day change"
msgstr[0] "Verandering in %(num)d dag"
msgstr[1] "Verandering in %(num)d dagen"

msgid "Invalid date."
msgstr "Ongeldige datum."

msgid "Invalid request."
msgstr "Ongeldig verzoek."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(weight)s is %(percent)s%% different from your entry of %(other)s on "
"%(date)s."
msgstr "%(weight)s wijkt %(percent)s%% af van je meting van %(other)s op %(date)s."

msgid "Enter a valid weight, like 72.5."
msgstr "Voer een geldig gewicht in, bijvoorbeeld 72,5."

#, python-format
msgid "Weight must be between %(min)s and %(max)s kg."
msgstr "Het gewicht moet tussen %(min)s en %(max)s kg liggen."

msgid "Invalid range."
msgstr "Ongeldig bereik."

msgid "Settings updated."
msgstr "Instellingen bijgewerkt."

msgid "Your chart is now public."
msgstr "Je grafiek is nu openbaar."

msgid "Your chart is no longer public."
msgstr "Je grafiek is niet meer openbaar."

#, python-format
msgid "Imported %(num)d entry."
msgid_plural "Imported %(num)d entries."
msgstr[0] "Geïmporteerd: %(num)d meting."
msgstr[1] "Geïmporteerd: %(num)d metingen."

#, python-format
msgid "Your height was set to %(height)s."
msgstr "Je lengte is ingesteld op %(height)s."

#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d note without a weight was skipped."
msgid_plural "%(num)d notes without a weight were skipped."
msgstr[0] "%(num)d notitie zonder gewicht is overgeslagen."
msgstr[1] "%(num)d notities zonder gewicht zijn overgeslagen."

#, python-format
msgid "%(details)s (+%(count)d more)"
msgstr "%(details)s (+%(count)d meer)"

#, python-format
msgid "Skipped %(num)d invalid line: %(details)s"
msgid_plural "Skipped %(num)d invalid lines: %(details)s"
msgstr[0] "Overgeslagen: %(num)d ongeldige regel: %(details)s"
msgstr[1] "Overgeslagen: %(num)d ongeldige regels: %(details)s"

msgid "No rows found in the file."
msgstr "Geen regels gevonden in het bestand."

msgid "Back"
msgstr "Terug"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Over"

msgid "Back to the dashboard"
msgstr "Terug naar het overzicht"

msgid "About Kilo Tracker"
msgstr "Over Kilo Tracker"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"For many years I tracked my weight with %(hdo_link)s, created by "
"%(walker_link)s. It kept working for a good while after his death, but in "
"March 2026 it finally stopped."
msgstr ""
"Jarenlang hield ik mijn gewicht bij met %(hdo_link)s, gemaakt door "
"%(walker_link)s. Het bleef nog een flinke tijd werken na zijn overlijden, "
"maar in maart 2026 hield het er uiteindelijk mee op."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"I tried %(yadt_link)s as a replacement, but its interface wasn't for me. So "
"I vibe-coded my own version, and Kilo Tracker is the result. It's free for "
"anyone to use."
msgstr ""
"Ik probeerde %(yadt_link)s als vervanger, maar de interface beviel me niet. "
"Dus heb ik met vibe coding mijn eigen versie gebouwd, en Kilo Tracker is het"
" resultaat geworden. Iedereen kan het gratis gebruiken."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Kilo Tracker is open source software. You can download the source code and "
"run your own copy from %(github_link)s."
msgstr ""
"Kilo Tracker is open-sourcesoftware. Je kunt de broncode downloaden en een "
"eigen kopie draaien via %(github_link)s."

#, python-format
msgid "I hope you like it! You can reach me at %(mail_link)s."
msgstr "Ik hoop dat je het mooi vindt! Je kunt me bereiken op %(mail_link)s."

#. Version of the app, with the date of its last change. %(version)s is a link
#. such as v1.2 or a commit id.
#, python-format
msgid "Version %(version)s &middot; committed %(date)s"
msgstr "Versie %(version)s &middot; gecommit op %(date)s"

#, python-format
msgid "Version %(version)s"
msgstr "Versie %(version)s"

# machine-translated
msgid "Video tutorial"
msgstr "Videohandleiding"

# machine-translated
msgid ""
"A 13-minute video on YouTube shows how Kilo Tracker works, from signing in "
"to sharing your chart and taking your data with you."
msgstr ""
"Een video van 13 minuten op YouTube laat zien hoe Kilo Tracker werkt, van "
"inloggen tot het delen van je grafiek en het meenemen van je gegevens."

# machine-translated
msgid "Watch the Kilo Tracker video tutorial on YouTube"
msgstr "Bekijk de videohandleiding van Kilo Tracker op YouTube"

msgid "How signing in works"
msgstr "Hoe inloggen werkt"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"There are no passwords. Enter your email and we send a 6-digit code that's "
"valid for %(num)s minute — enter it and you're signed in."
msgid_plural ""
"There are no passwords. Enter your email and we send a 6-digit code that's "
"valid for %(num)s minutes — enter it and you're signed in."
msgstr[0] ""
"Er zijn geen wachtwoorden. Voer je e-mailadres in en we sturen een code van "
"6 cijfers die %(num)s minuut geldig is – voer die in en je bent ingelogd."
msgstr[1] ""
"Er zijn geen wachtwoorden. Voer je e-mailadres in en we sturen een code van "
"6 cijfers die %(num)s minuten geldig is – voer die in en je bent ingelogd."

msgid "Gravatar uses"
msgstr "Gravatar gebruikt"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"We never store your email address itself in our database. Instead we keep a "
"one-way SHA-256 hash of it (the same scheme %(gravatar_hash_link)s)."
msgstr ""
"We slaan je e-mailadres zelf nooit op in onze database. In plaats daarvan "
"bewaren we er een eenrichtings-SHA-256-hash van (hetzelfde schema dat "
"%(gravatar_hash_link)s)."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"That hash also doubles as your Gravatar id — if you have an avatar set up at"
" %(gravatar_link)s, it shows up automatically once you're signed in."
msgstr ""
"Die hash dient ook als je Gravatar-id: als je een avatar hebt ingesteld op "
"%(gravatar_link)s, verschijnt die automatisch zodra je bent ingelogd."

msgid ""
"Kilo fetches that avatar from Gravatar itself and keeps a copy for a day, so"
" Gravatar never sees your visits, your browser or your IP address."
msgstr ""
"Kilo haalt die avatar zelf bij Gravatar op en bewaart een kopie voor één "
"dag, zodat Gravatar nooit je bezoeken, je browser of je IP-adres ziet."

#. Label of the menu that picks the language of the website.
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Taal"

#. First choice in the language menu: follow the language set in the web
#. browser.
msgid "Browser language"
msgstr "Taal van de browser"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

# machine-translated
#. Link for keyboard users at the very top of every page; it jumps past the
#. header.
msgid "Skip to main content"
msgstr "Naar de hoofdinhoud"

msgid "Signed in"
msgstr "Ingelogd"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Instellingen"

msgid "Log out"
msgstr "Uitloggen"

#. Heading of the page shown when the server had an unexpected error.
msgid "Something went wrong"
msgstr "Er ging iets mis"

msgid "If you were saving something, check whether it was saved and try again."
msgstr ""
"Was je iets aan het opslaan? Controleer dan of het is opgeslagen en probeer "
"het opnieuw."

msgid "Back to the start page"
msgstr "Terug naar de startpagina"

#. Title of the public page that shows someone's weight chart.
msgid "Weight chart"
msgstr "Gewichtsgrafiek"

# machine-translated
#. Link for keyboard users at the top of the dashboard; it jumps past the chart
#. and the numbers to the list of days.
msgid "Skip to the daily log"
msgstr "Naar het dagoverzicht"

# machine-translated
#. Screen-reader label of the weight field of one day in the daily log;
#. %(date)s is a date such as 24 Oct 2026.
#, python-format
msgid "Weight on %(date)s"
msgstr "Gewicht op %(date)s"

# machine-translated
#. Screen-reader label of the note button of one day in the daily log; %(date)s
#. is a date such as 24 Oct 2026.
#, python-format
msgid "Note for %(date)s"
msgstr "Notitie bij %(date)s"

msgid "No note"
msgstr "Geen notitie"

msgid "Add a note…"
msgstr "Notitie toevoegen…"

#. Tooltip and screen-reader label of the button that opens a panel of emoji to
#. put in a note.
msgid "Insert an emoji"
msgstr "Emoji invoegen"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Annuleren"

#. Button that saves a note (verb).
#. Button that saves the settings (verb).
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Opslaan"

#. Label above the latest moving-average weight.
msgid "Current average"
msgstr "Huidig gemiddelde"

msgid "No entries yet."
msgstr "Nog geen metingen."

msgid "No entries yet — add your weight below."
msgstr "Nog geen metingen – voeg hieronder je gewicht toe."

#. BMI is Body Mass Index; keep the abbreviation people know in your language.
msgid "BMI"
msgstr "BMI"

#. Third line of the BMI box: the body height in metres, for example "Height:
#. 1.86 m". %(height)s already includes the unit.
#, python-format
msgid "Height: %(height)s"
msgstr "Lengte: %(height)s"

msgid "Set your height"
msgstr "Stel je lengte in"

#, python-format
msgid "Show the %(range)s chart"
msgstr "Toon de grafiek van %(range)s"

msgid "Show the whole history in the chart"
msgstr "Toon de hele geschiedenis in de grafiek"

#. Heading of the box about the logged weigh-ins: first date, last date and how
#. many.
msgid "Entries"
msgstr "Metingen"

#. The date of the first entry.
msgid "First"
msgstr "Eerste"

#. The date of the last (most recent) entry.
msgid "Last"
msgstr "Laatste"

#. The total number of entries.
msgid "Total"
msgstr "Totaal"

msgid "Daily log"
msgstr "Dagoverzicht"

msgid "Scroll to the most recent entry"
msgstr "Scroll naar de meest recente meting"

msgid "Most recent entry"
msgstr "Meest recente meting"

#. Column headers of the daily log: the day, the weight in kilograms, and a
#. free-text note.
msgid "Date"
msgstr "Datum"

msgid "Weight (kg)"
msgstr "Gewicht (kg)"

msgid "Note"
msgstr "Notitie"

#. Heading above the emoji the user picked most recently.
msgid "Recently used"
msgstr "Onlangs gebruikt"

msgid "Loading more days…"
msgstr "Meer dagen aan het laden…"

msgid "Log today's weight?"
msgstr "Gewicht van vandaag invoeren?"

msgid "You haven't recorded a weight for today yet."
msgstr "Je hebt voor vandaag nog geen gewicht ingevoerd."

msgid "e.g. 82.4"
msgstr "bijv. 82,4"

msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Overslaan"

msgid "Unusual value"
msgstr "Ongewone waarde"

msgid "Correct it"
msgstr "Aanpassen"

msgid "Save anyway"
msgstr "Toch opslaan"

#. Button that brings back a weight that was just deleted from the daily log.
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Ongedaan maken"

#. Title of a dialog: the login session has timed out; the page must be
#. reloaded.
msgid "Session expired"
msgstr "Sessie is verlopen"

#. Button that reloads the web page.
msgid "Reload page"
msgstr "Pagina opnieuw laden"

# machine-translated
#. Name of the whole period (the "All" range button) in the chart's description
#. for screen readers.
msgid "All weigh-ins"
msgstr "Alle metingen"

# machine-translated
#. The chart in words, for screen readers. %(period)s is a period such as "3
#. months"; the weights are such as "82.4 kg".
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(period)s: from %(first)s on %(first_date)s to %(last)s on %(last_date)s. "
"Lowest %(lowest)s, highest %(highest)s, average %(average)s."
msgstr ""
"%(period)s: van %(first)s op %(first_date)s tot %(last)s op %(last_date)s. "
"Laagste %(lowest)s, hoogste %(highest)s, gemiddeld %(average)s."

# machine-translated
#. The chart in words, for screen readers, when the period shown has no
#. weights.
#, python-format
msgid "%(period)s: no weigh-ins in this period."
msgstr "%(period)s: geen metingen in deze periode."

# machine-translated
#. The chart in words when the owner hides the weights on the public page: only
#. the line's direction.
#, python-format
msgid "%(period)s: the line ends lower than it starts."
msgstr "%(period)s: de lijn eindigt lager dan hij begint."

# machine-translated
#. The chart in words when the owner hides the weights on the public page: only
#. the line's direction.
#, python-format
msgid "%(period)s: the line ends higher than it starts."
msgstr "%(period)s: de lijn eindigt hoger dan hij begint."

# machine-translated
#. The chart in words when the owner hides the weights on the public page: only
#. the line's direction.
#, python-format
msgid "%(period)s: the line ends at the same height as it starts."
msgstr "%(period)s: de lijn eindigt even hoog als hij begint."

#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d-day average"
msgid_plural "%(num)d-day average"
msgstr[0] "Gemiddelde over %(num)d dag"
msgstr[1] "Gemiddelde over %(num)d dagen"

msgid "Overall average"
msgstr "Totaalgemiddelde"

#, python-format
msgid "BMI (%(num)d-day avg): %(bmi)s"
msgid_plural "BMI (%(num)d-day avg): %(bmi)s"
msgstr[0] "BMI (gem. %(num)d dag): %(bmi)s"
msgstr[1] "BMI (gem. %(num)d dagen): %(bmi)s"

msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "Opslaan…"

msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Opgeslagen"

msgid "Could not save"
msgstr "Opslaan is mislukt"

msgid "Could not save."
msgstr "Opslaan is mislukt."

msgid "Error saving"
msgstr "Fout bij het opslaan"

#, python-format
msgid "Weight of %(date)s removed."
msgstr "Gewicht van %(date)s verwijderd."

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Inloggen"

msgid "Enter your email and we'll send you a 6-digit code — no password needed."
msgstr ""
"Voer je e-mailadres in en we sturen je een code van 6 cijfers – geen "
"wachtwoord nodig."

msgid "Send code"
msgstr "Code versturen"

msgid "How does this work?"
msgstr "Hoe werkt dit?"

#. Shown at a public chart's address when there is no chart there, or its owner
#. stopped sharing it.
msgid "There is no public chart at this address (any more)."
msgstr "Er is geen openbare grafiek (meer) beschikbaar op dit adres."

msgid "Remove my data"
msgstr "Mijn gegevens verwijderen"

msgid "Back to settings"
msgstr "Terug naar instellingen"

msgid ""
"This permanently deletes your account, all your weigh-ins and notes, and "
"your settings. It can't be undone."
msgstr ""
"Hiermee worden je account, al je metingen en notities en je instellingen "
"definitief verwijderd. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."

msgid "Step 1: Download your data"
msgstr "Stap 1: Download je gegevens"

msgid "download it again"
msgstr "opnieuw downloaden"

#, python-format
msgid "Downloaded. You can %(again_link)s."
msgstr "Gedownload. Je kunt het %(again_link)s."

msgid "Download a copy of your weigh-ins before they're deleted. This is required."
msgstr ""
"Download een kopie van je metingen voordat ze worden verwijderd. Dit is "
"verplicht."

msgid "Download my data (CSV)"
msgstr "Mijn gegevens downloaden (CSV)"

msgid "I've downloaded it — continue"
msgstr "Ik heb het gedownload – verder"

msgid "Step 2: Confirm by email"
msgstr "Stap 2: Bevestig per e-mail"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"We sent a 6-digit code to <strong>%(email)s</strong>. It expires in %(num)s "
"minute."
msgid_plural ""
"We sent a 6-digit code to <strong>%(email)s</strong>. It expires in %(num)s "
"minutes."
msgstr[0] ""
"We hebben een code van 6 cijfers naar <strong>%(email)s</strong> gestuurd. "
"De code verloopt over %(num)s minuut."
msgstr[1] ""
"We hebben een code van 6 cijfers naar <strong>%(email)s</strong> gestuurd. "
"De code verloopt over %(num)s minuten."

msgid "Delete everything"
msgstr "Alles verwijderen"

msgid "Resend code"
msgstr "Code opnieuw versturen"

#, python-format
msgid "We'll email a confirmation code to <strong>%(email)s</strong>."
msgstr "We mailen een bevestigingscode naar <strong>%(email)s</strong>."

msgid "Send confirmation code"
msgstr "Bevestigingscode versturen"

msgid "Your height is used to calculate your BMI."
msgstr "Je lengte wordt gebruikt om je BMI te berekenen."

#. Heading of the settings section about showing the weight chart on a public
#. web page.
msgid "Public chart"
msgstr "Openbare grafiek"

msgid ""
"Show your chart and stat boxes on a public page that anyone with the link "
"can see, and that you can embed in another website. Your notes, your email "
"address and your daily log are never shown."
msgstr ""
"Toon je grafiek en statistiekvakken op een openbare pagina die iedereen met "
"de link kan zien en die je in een andere website kunt insluiten. Je "
"notities, je e-mailadres en je dagoverzicht worden nooit getoond."

msgid ""
"Switched off, the chart shows only the shape of the line: no kilograms, no "
"BMI and no stat boxes."
msgstr ""
"Uitgeschakeld toont de grafiek alleen de vorm van de lijn: geen kilo's, geen"
" BMI en geen statistiekvakken."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The last part of the page's address: %(min)d to %(max)d letters (a-z), "
"digits, hyphens or underscores. Leave it empty for a new random ID."
msgstr ""
"Het laatste deel van het adres van de pagina: %(min)d tot %(max)d letters "
"(a-z), cijfers, koppeltekens of liggende streepjes. Laat het leeg voor een "
"nieuwe willekeurige ID."

#. Label of a menu in the settings: which period the shared chart shows.
msgid "Chart range"
msgstr "Periode van de grafiek"

#. First choice of the chart range menu: the chart keeps its range buttons and
#. the visitor picks.
msgid "Visitor chooses (range buttons)"
msgstr "Bezoeker kiest (periodeknoppen)"

msgid "Your public chart:"
msgstr "Je openbare grafiek:"

msgid "To show it in another website, put this code in that page's HTML:"
msgstr ""
"Om hem in een andere website te tonen, zet je deze code in de HTML van die "
"pagina:"

msgid "Import data"
msgstr "Gegevens importeren"

#. The text in <code> only names the three columns of a line such as
#. 23-9-26,79.7,text. Translate the names (date, weight, note): the file itself
#. has no header and is the same in every language.
msgid ""
"Import weigh-ins from a CSV text file. Each line is "
"<code>date,weight,note</code> (note is optional), for example:"
msgstr ""
"Importeer metingen uit een CSV-tekstbestand. Elke regel is "
"<code>datum,gewicht,notitie</code> (de notitie is optioneel), bijvoorbeeld:"

#. Example notes in the CSV sample. The CSV format itself (dates, dot as
#. decimal separator) stays the same in every language.
msgid "optional notes"
msgstr "optionele notities"

msgid "some text"
msgstr "wat tekst"

#. d-M-yy and d-M-yyyy describe the date pattern, as in 23-9-26 or 23-9-2026.
#. Use the first letter of the word for day, month (keep a capital M, so it
#. cannot be mistaken for minutes) and year in your language, e.g. j-M-aa in
#. French. The numbers in the file are always day-month-year.
msgid ""
"Dates are <code>d-M-yy</code> or <code>d-M-yyyy</code>; weight is in "
"kilograms. Importing a date that already has an entry overwrites it."
msgstr ""
"Datums zijn <code>d-M-jj</code> of <code>d-M-jjjj</code>; het gewicht is in "
"kilogram. Bij het importeren van een datum die al een meting heeft, wordt "
"die overschreven."

#. "The Hacker's Diet Online" and "Yet Another Diet Tool" are names of web
#. services; do not translate them.
msgid ""
"You can also import the CSV or XML export of The Hacker's Diet Online, or "
"the CSV export of Yet Another Diet Tool. Weights, notes and, from the XML "
"file, your height are imported; everything else is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Je kunt ook de CSV- of XML-export van The Hacker's Diet Online importeren, "
"of de CSV-export van Yet Another Diet Tool. Gewichten, notities en, uit het "
"XML-bestand, je lengte worden geïmporteerd; al het andere wordt genegeerd."

msgid "Import"
msgstr "Importeren"

msgid "Export data"
msgstr "Gegevens exporteren"

msgid "Download all your weigh-ins as a CSV file (date, weight in kilograms, note)."
msgstr ""
"Download al je metingen als CSV-bestand (datum, gewicht in kilogram, "
"notitie)."

msgid "Export CSV"
msgstr "CSV exporteren"

#. Heading of the settings section that ends the sign-in on every other browser
#. and device.
msgid "Sign out everywhere"
msgstr "Overal uitloggen"

msgid ""
"Signed in on a computer that isn't yours, or lost a phone? This signs you "
"out on every other browser and device. You stay signed in here."
msgstr ""
"Ingelogd op een computer die niet van jou is, of je telefoon kwijt? Hiermee "
"log je uit op elke andere browser en elk ander apparaat. Hier blijf je "
"ingelogd."

#. Button that ends the sign-in on all other browsers and devices (not on this
#. one).
msgid "Sign out on other devices"
msgstr "Uitloggen op andere apparaten"

msgid ""
"Permanently delete your account and all your weigh-ins. You'll be asked to "
"download your data and confirm with a code sent by email first."
msgstr ""
"Verwijder je account en al je metingen definitief. Eerst word je gevraagd je"
" gegevens te downloaden en te bevestigen met een code die per e-mail is "
"verstuurd."

msgid "Remove my data…"
msgstr "Mijn gegevens verwijderen…"

msgid "Sign up"
msgstr "Registreren"

msgid "Enter your email and we'll send you a 6-digit verification code."
msgstr "Voer je e-mailadres in en we sturen je een verificatiecode van 6 cijfers."

msgid "Verify your email"
msgstr "Bevestig je e-mailadres"

msgid "Enter your code"
msgstr "Voer je code in"

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Bevestigen"

